# task-commander

ClickUp task management with Slack notifications, plus Gmail and Calendar steps through the gog CLI.

## MCP Configuration

MCP servers for this plugin are in `.cursor/mcp.json`. Environment variables use `${env:VAR_NAME}` syntax in Cursor.
